%% Patient Booking and WhatsApp
%% Summary: Shows slot confirmation, patient appointment listing, and consent-based post-commit WhatsApp attempts.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Patient
    participant App as Booking App
    participant Auth as Auth and Access
    participant Schedule as Shared Scheduling Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as WhatsApp Worker or Request Handler
    participant Meta as Meta WhatsApp API

    Note over Patient,Meta: Patient Booking and WhatsApp<br/>Shows slot confirmation, patient appointment listing, and consent-based post-commit WhatsApp attempts.

    App-->>Patient: Show available dates and slots
    Patient->>App: Select slot, enter details and optional WhatsApp consent
    App->>Schedule: Confirm booking request
    Schedule->>DB: Lock doctor, recheck slot and policy
    alt Slot unavailable or policy rejects
        DB-->>Schedule: Reject
        Schedule-->>App: Validation/conflict result
        App-->>Patient: Choose another slot or follow policy guidance
    else Booking accepted
        Schedule->>DB: Commit appointment, occupancy, audit, receipt and consent/job
        DB-->>Schedule: Commit succeeded
        Schedule-->>App: Confirmed appointment
        App-->>Patient: Show confirmation
        opt Active WhatsApp consent
            App->>Worker: Attempt post-commit notification or leave queued job
            Worker->>DB: Claim job and save safe attempt record
            Worker->>Meta: Send using test sender and fixed owner test recipient
            Meta-->>Worker: Accepted, rejected or outcome uncertain
            Worker->>DB: Record result and retry safe failures as configured
            Note over Worker,Meta: API acceptance is not proof of delivery, and failures do not undo booking.
        end
    end

    Patient->>App: Open My appointments
    App->>Auth: Check patient session and ownership
    Auth->>DB: Read only explicitly linked appointments
    DB-->>App: Patient's appointments
    App-->>Patient: Show appointment history and status
